              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='99' h='11111' id='135' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Delivery-Hero-Comet.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='13538' x='615' y='889'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='9445' id='136' type-v2='text' w='98770' x='615' y='89666'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This table summarizes all the different action and the average number of steps per action that users take before reaching the first add-to-cart. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Calculation:- Avg Steps:- Total Number of Steps (to a specific event) / Total number of distinct sessions. For e.g:- If it says that it takes 3.33 Avg Steps (Assumption:- there are only 3 sessions) to reach the first ATC, it can mean that it could have taken 4 steps in the first session for the user to reach the first ATC, 3 in the second and 3 in the third. Hence, the average for these 3 sessions is 3.33 AVG Steps.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Note: The conditional formatting is based on the numbers of the column. The lower the number the greener it will show and vice-versa for red.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='5222' id='140' mode='dropdown' name='Table' param='[federated.1etspkn1x1g45u1ae1j7d0bnbt9w (copy)].[none:brand:nk]' type-v2='filter' values='relevant' w='16384' x='64385' y='6778'>
