                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='6222' id='37' mode='checkdropdown' name='AvgStepsStatistic' param='[federated.0pta7c11sg336r18pzbut11owone (copy 2)].[none:is_transaction_happened:nk]' show-apply='true' type-v2='filter' values='database' w='20231' x='61077' y='1778'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='67000' id='28' is-fixed='true' name='AvgStepsStatistic' w='97540' x='1230' y='19333'>
                  <layout-cache type-h='fixed' type-w='fixed' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11889' id='126' type-v2='text' w='97540' x='1230' y='86333'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This table summarizes all the steps that users take when they complete their journey, similar to the previos tab it enables us in total avg how many steps are taken for each category till they are added to the cart.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Calculation:- Avg Steps:- Total Number of Steps (to a specific event) / Total number of distinct sessions. For e.g:- If it says that it takes 3.33 Avg Steps (Assumption:- there are only 3 sessions) to reach the first ATC, it can mean that it could have taken 4 steps in the first session for the user to reach the first ATC, 3 in the second and 3 in the third. Hence, the average for these 3 sessions is 3.33 AVG Steps.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Note: The conditional formatting is based on the numbers of the column. The higher the number the greener it will show and vice-versa for red.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{FB616602-378E-49D1-A888-216ADBD1E35C}' />
    </dashboard>
