          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7311' id='137' type-v2='text' w='98770' x='615' y='92022'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This chart illustrates where customers spend the most time while they are starting their basket and whether there are any differences across categories, such as Beverages category. Purchasers who add this category as their first item tend to visit more search sites than other buyers. Therefore, it highlights the key areas to concentrate on to make it simpler for the user to begin their basket.  Each step denotes the contribution of the specific action/event.</run>
            </formatted-text>
