    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Introduction'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/DMartPathtoPurchase/Introduction?rev=' id='Introduction' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/PERSEUSPANDORADM-Commercial-MediaSolution-P2P' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_3' value='top' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_6' value='top' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_18' value='top' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_19' value='top' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_8' value='top' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_10' value='top' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='1300' maxwidth='1300' minheight='1300' minwidth='1300' preset-index='1' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone fixed-size='99' h='16000' id='7' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Delivery-Hero-Comet.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='24200' x='800' y='1000'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='16000' id='8' type-v2='text' w='74200' x='25000' y='1000'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c83201' fontsize='30'>Path to Purchase</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontsize='14'>QUICK-COMMERCE</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='5750' id='9' param='Image/Screenshot 2021-07-12 at 15.39.29.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='17000'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='69500' id='10' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='29500'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#343b46' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>This dashboard aims to depict users’ behavior on the platform – focusing on the steps taken using front end data. Please kindly keep in mind that due to the data size, we need to limit the data shown on the dashboard. The dashboard only showing top 10 most common path covering approx. 80% of the steps, in other words the data is a sample data from overall users.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d61f26' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>1. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='12'>First 5 Steps Visit:</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d1d2d3' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>This tab showcases a Sankey chart that illustrates the first five actions taken by users upon arriving on the platform, starting with the addition of a category. (The data here is for transacted sessions only.) Sample insight: </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Produce category shoppers spend significantly more time on the search in Thailand compared to Hungary. (Search is more important for produce category in TH than HU)</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d61f26' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>2.</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'> 5 Steps before first Add to Cart:</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d1d2d3' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='12'>This tab provides a more in-depth look at the actions taken by a user prior to adding an item to their shopping cart. This information can be valuable in understanding the steps and interactions that lead up to a customer making a purchase and can help identify potential friction points or areas for improvement in the user experience. (The data here is for both transacted and non transacted sessions.) </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='12'>Sample insight: </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='12' italic='true'>The Frozen Category has more interactions with the product detail page compared to other categories before adding items to the cart, indicating higher research time. This behavior can be leveraged by optimizing the product detail page and creating targeted marketing strategies to drive conversions.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>3. Overview tab:</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>provides a breakdown of the time spent in a session, both for transacted and non-transacted interactions. It also displays the categories present in the basket in different time brackets. Sample insight: </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Approximately half of sessions that end in a transaction occur within 10 minutes.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>4. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='12'>Category Steps:</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='12'> The tab provides a summary of the average number of actions taken by users before adding an item from a specific category to their shopping cart. This information can help us understand the engagement level for different categories and identify areas where users might be dropping off or facing difficulty in finding what they are looking for. By analyzing the number of steps taken to add an item to the cart, we can make informed decisions on how to optimize the customer experience and drive conversions. </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='12'>Sample insight: </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='12' italic='true'>The personal care category stands out with the highest number of visits to its product detail pages, indicating the need for increased emphasis on content creation, as users&apos; behavior suggests that this aspect of their journey is particularly significant.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>5. Category Steps First Add to Cart:</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>This tab presents a similar summary as the &quot;Category Steps&quot; tab but focuses specifically on the average number of steps taken until a user adds the first item from a category to their shopping cart for the first time. This information provides an understanding of which categories tend to start the shopping basket, as well as any trends or patterns in customer behavior when starting a purchase journey. (The data here is for transacted sessions only.) Sample insight: </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' italic='true'>When it comes to the tobacco category, shoppers who choose basket starter tend to take fewer steps before adding an item to their cart compared to the category average, indicating a higher level of focus.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d61f26' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>How to read the Sankey chart? </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>The chart needs to be read from left to right and shows the next five steps. The percentage at each step shows the contribution of each possible action on that specific step. The succeeding step shows the action and percentage of the action on average of the next step taken linked to the prior stage. For example, the first step of this tab is going to be the first action that the user takes after entering to the platform. The last step for this tab will be the fifth step of the user after entering the platform.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6750' id='13' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='22750'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#df3534' fontsize='30'>JOURNEYS ON THE PLATFORM</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
