                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='69500' id='10' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='29500'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#343b46' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>This dashboard aims to depict users’ behavior on the platform – focusing on the steps taken using front end data. Please kindly keep in mind that due to the data size, we need to limit the data shown on the dashboard. The dashboard only showing top 10 most common path covering approx. 80% of the steps, in other words the data is a sample data from overall users.</run>
