                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='12'> The tab provides a summary of the average number of actions taken by users before adding an item from a specific category to their shopping cart. This information can help us understand the engagement level for different categories and identify areas where users might be dropping off or facing difficulty in finding what they are looking for. By analyzing the number of steps taken to add an item to the cart, we can make informed decisions on how to optimize the customer experience and drive conversions. </run>
