                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='12' italic='true'>The personal care category stands out with the highest number of visits to its product detail pages, indicating the need for increased emphasis on content creation, as users&apos; behavior suggests that this aspect of their journey is particularly significant.</run>
